ralized Riemann hypothesis](#Consequences_of_the_generalized_Riemann_hypothesis) + [3.7 Excluded middle](#Excluded_middle) - [3.7.1 Littlewood's theorem](#Littlewood's_theorem) - [3.7.2 Gauss's class number conjecture](#Gauss's_class_number_conjecture) - [3.7.3 Growth of Euler's totient](#Growth_of_Euler's_totient) * [4 Generalizations and analogs](#Generalizations_and_analogs) + [4.1 Dirichlet L-series and other number fields](#Dirichlet_L-series_and_other_number_fields) + [4.2 Function fields and zeta functions of varieties over finite fields](#Function_fields_and_zeta_functions_of_varieties_over_finite_fields) + [4.3 Arithmetic zeta functions of arithmetic schemes and their L-factors](#Arithmetic_zeta_functions_of_arithmetic_schemes_and_their_L-factors) + [4.4 Selberg zeta functions](#Selberg_zeta_functions) + [4.5 Ihara zeta functions](#Ihara_zeta_functions) + [4.6 Montgomery's pair correlation conjecture](#Montgomery's_pair_correlation_conjecture) + [4.7 Other zeta functions](#Other_zeta_functions) * [5 Attempted proofs](#Attempted_proofs) + [5.1 Operator theory](#Operator_theory) + [5.2 Lee–Yang theorem](#Lee–Yang_theorem) + [5.3 Turán's result](#Turán's_result) + [5.4 Noncommutative geometry](#Noncommutative_geometry) + [5.5 Hilbert spaces of entire functions](#Hilbert_spaces_of_entire_functions) + [5.6 Quasicrystals](#Quasicrystals) + [5.7 Arithmetic zeta functions of models of elliptic curves over number fields](#Arithmetic_zeta_functions_of_models_of_elliptic_curves_over_number_fields) + [5.8 Multiple zeta functions](#Multiple_zeta_functions) * [6 Location of the zeros](#Location_of_the_zeros) + [6.1 Number of zeros](#Number_of_zeros) + [6.2 Theorem of Hadamard and de la Vallée-Poussin](#Theorem_of_Hadamard_and_de_la_Vallée-Poussin) + [6.3 Zero-free regions](#Zero-free_regions) * [7 Zeros on the critical line](#Zeros_on_the_critical_line) + [7.1 Hardy–Littlewood conjectures](#Hardy–Littlewood_conjectures) + [7.2 Selberg's zeta function conjecture](#Selberg's_zeta_function_conjecture) + [7.3 Numerical calculations](#Numerical_calculations) + [7.4 Gram points](#Gram_points) + [7.5 Random matrix theory and quantum chaos](#Random_matrix_theory_and_quantum_chaos) * [8 Arguments for and against the Riemann hypothesis](#Arguments_for_and_against_the_Riemann_hypothesis) * [9 Notes](#Notes) * [10 References](#References) + [10.1 Popular expositions](#Popular_expositions) * [11 External links](#External_links) # Riemann hypothesis * [العربية](https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D9%81%D8%B1%D8%B6%D9%8A%D8%A9_%D8%B1%D9%8A%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86 \"فرضية ريمان – Arabic\") * [Asturianu](https://ast.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip%C3%B3tesis_de_Riemann \"Hipótesis de Riemann – Asturian\") * [Беларуская](https://be.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D1%96%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%8D%D0%B7%D0%B0_%D0%A0%D1%8B%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0 \"Гіпотэза Рымана – Belarusian\") * [Български](https://bg.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A5%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0_%D0%BD%D0%B0_%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD \"Хипотеза на Риман – Bulgarian\") * [বাংলা](https://bn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A6%B0%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%AE%E0%A7%8D%E0%A6%AF%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%A8_%E0%A6%B9%E0%A6%BE%E0%A6%87%E0%A6%AA%E0%A7%8B%E0%A6%A5%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%B8%E0%A6%BF%E0%A6%B8 \"রিম্যান হাইপোথিসিস – Bangla\") * [Català](https://ca.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip%C3%B2tesi_de_Riemann \"Hipòtesi de Riemann – Catalan\") * [کوردی](https://ckb.wikipedia.org/wiki/%DA%AF%D8%B1%DB%8C%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86%DB%95%DB%8C_%DA%95%DB%8C%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86 \"گریمانەی ڕیمان – Central Kurdish\") * [Čeština](https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannova_hypot%C3%A9za \"Riemannova hypotéza – Czech\") * [Dansk](https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann-hypotesen \"Riemann-hypotesen – Danish\") * [Deutsch](https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannsche_Vermutung \"Riemannsche Vermutung – German\") * [Ελληνικά](https://el.wikipedia.org/wiki/%CE%A5%CF%80%CF%8C%CE%B8%CE%B5%CF%83%CE%B7_%CE%A1%CE%AF%CE%BC%CE%B1%CE%BD \"Υπόθεση Ρίμαν – Greek\") * [Esperanto](https://eo.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rimana_hipotezo \"Rimana hipotezo – Esperanto\") * [Español](https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip%C3%B3tesis_de_Riemann \"Hipótesis de Riemann – Spanish\") * [Euskara](https://eu.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannen_hipotesi \"Riemannen hipotesi – Basque\") * [فارسی](https://fa.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D9%81%D8%B1%D8%B6%DB%8C%D9%87_%D8%B1%DB%8C%D9%85%D8%A7%D9%86 \"فرضیه ریمان – Persian\") * [Suomi](https://fi.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannin_hypoteesi \"Riemannin hypoteesi – Finnish\") * [Français](https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypoth%C3%A8se_de_Riemann \"Hypothèse de Riemann – French\") * [Galego](https://gl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip%C3%B3tese_de_Riemann \"Hipótese de Riemann – Galician\") * [עברית](https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%94%D7%A9%D7%A2%D7%A8%D7%AA_%D7%A8%D7%99%D7%9E%D7%9F \"השערת רימן – Hebrew\") * [हिन्दी](https://hi.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A5%88%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%A5%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8 \"रीमान हैपोथिसिस – Hindi\") * [Kreyòl ayisyen](https://ht.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipot%C3%A8z_Riemann \"Ipotèz Riemann – Haitian Creole\") * [Magyar](https://hu.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann-sejt%C3%A9s \"Riemann-sejtés – Hungarian\") * [Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hipotesis_Riemann \"Hipotesis Riemann – Indonesian\") * [Italiano](https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipotesi_di_Riemann \"Ipotesi di Riemann – Italian\") * [日本語](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E4%BA%88%E6%83%B3 \"リーマン予想 – Japanese\") * [Қазақша](https://kk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD_%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%8B \"Риман гипотезасы – Kazakh\") * [한국어](https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%A6%AC%EB%A7%8C_%EA%B0%80%EC%84%A4 \"리만 가설 – Korean\") * [Latina](https://la.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypothesis_Riemanniana \"Hypothesis Riemanniana – Latin\") * [Lietuvių](https://lt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rymano_hipotez%C4%97 \"Rymano hipotezė – Lithuanian\") * [Latviešu](https://lv.wikipedia.org/wiki/R%C4%ABma%C5%86a_hipot%C4%93ze \"Rīmaņa hipotēze – Latvian\") * [Монгол](https://mn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8B_%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BB \"Риманы таамаглал – Mongolian\") * [Bahasa Melayu](https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hipotesis_Riemann \"Hipotesis Riemann – Malay\") * [नेपाली](https://ne.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%8F%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%87%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%A5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8 \"रिएमन्न हाइपोथेसिस – Nepali\") * [Nederlands](https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann-hypothese \"Riemann-hypothese – Dutch\") * [Norsk nynorsk](https://nn.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannhypotesen \"Riemannhypotesen – Norwegian Nynorsk\") * [Norsk bokmål](https://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann-hypotesen \"Riemann-hypotesen – Norwegian Bokmål\") * [Polski](https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hipoteza_Riemanna \"Hipoteza Riemanna – Polish\") * [Português](https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip%C3%B3tese_de_Riemann \"Hipótese de Riemann – Portuguese\") * [Romnă](https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipoteza_Riemann \"Ipoteza Riemann – Romanian\") * [Русский](https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0_%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0 \"Гипотеза Римана – Russian\") * [Sicilianu](https://scn.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ip%C3%B2tisi_di_Riemann \"Ipòtisi di Riemann – Sicilian\") * [Simple English](https://simple.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann_hypothesis \"Riemann hypothesis – Simple English\") * [Slovenčina](https://sk.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannova_hypot%C3%A9za \"Riemannova hypotéza – Slovak\") * [Slovenščina](https://sl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannova_domneva \"Riemannova domneva – Slovenian\") * [Shqip](https://sq.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hipoteza_e_Riemannit \"Hipoteza e Riemannit – Albanian\") * [Српски / srpski](https://sr.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0_%D1%85%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B7%