\") * [日本語](https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%9E%E3%83%B3%E4%BA%88%E6%83%B3 \"リーマン予想 – Japanese\") * [Қазақша](https://kk.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD_%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%8B \"Риман гипотезасы – Kazakh\") * [한국어](https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EB%A6%AC%EB%A7%8C_%EA%B0%80%EC%84%A4 \"리만 가설 – Korean\") * [Latina](https://la.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hypothesis_Riemanniana \"Hypothesis Riemanniana – Latin\") * [Lietuvių](https://lt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rymano_hipotez%C4%97 \"Rymano hipotezė – Lithuanian\") * [Latviešu](https://lv.wikipedia.org/wiki/R%C4%ABma%C5%86a_hipot%C4%93ze \"Rīmaņa hipotēze – Latvian\") * [Монгол](https://mn.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8B_%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BB \"Риманы таамаглал – Mongolian\") * [Bahasa Melayu](https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hipotesis_Riemann \"Hipotesis Riemann – Malay\") * [नेपाली](https://ne.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%8F%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%A8_%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%87%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%A5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B8 \"रिएमन्न हाइपोथेसिस – Nepali\") * [Nederlands](https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann-hypothese \"Riemann-hypothese – Dutch\") * [Norsk nynorsk](https://nn.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemannhypotesen \"Riemannhypotesen – Norwegian Nynorsk\") * [Norsk bokmål](https://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann-hypotesen \"Riemann-hypotesen – Norwegian Bokmål\") * [Polski](https://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hipoteza_Riemanna \"Hipoteza Riemanna – Polish\") * [Português](https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hip%C3%B3tese_de_Riemann \"Hipótese de Riemann – Portuguese\") * [Romnă](https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ipoteza_Riemann \"Ipoteza Riemann – Romanian\") * [Русский](https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0_%D0%A0%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B0 \"Гипотеза Римана – Russian\") * [Sicilianu](https://scn.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ip%C3%B2tisi_di_Riemann \